## Overview
<a id="overview"></a>

Google Map Saver is a powerful tool designed to help users save maps from Google Maps easily. Whether you need maps for educational purposes, planning, or personal use, this software provides a straightforward solution by allowing you to customize the map settings according to your preferences. Unlike typical alternatives that rely solely on screen capture, Google Map Saver offers a more efficient way to save high-quality maps tailored to your specific needs.

This latest stable release 2026 comes with a full feature set, ensuring that all premium features are included and no locked features are present. Users can enjoy a complete package that allows them to save maps in various formats and resolutions, completely free of charge. Don’t miss out on the chance to optimize your map-saving experience. Download from the official source today to access the full capabilities of Google Map Saver. Last verified: 2026.

The current version is available for immediate download.

## Main Features
<a id="main-features"></a>

### Core Functionality
- **Custom Area Selection** — Users can specify the exact area on Google Maps to center the map, ensuring that they capture only the relevant information they need.
- **Map Type Options** — Google Map Saver allows users to choose from different map types such as maps, satellite, hybrid, or terrain, tailoring the output to their specific requirements.
- **Multiple Image Formats** — Save the maps in various formats including JPEG, PNG, BMP, and TGA, making it versatile for different applications.
- **Resolution and Zoom Control** — Users can adjust the resolution and zoom level of the map, providing flexibility in how the final image appears.
- **Coordinate Display** — The application shows the exact coordinates of the selected locations, enhancing the usability of saved maps for navigation or reference.

### Advanced Capabilities
- **User-Friendly Interface** — The intuitive interface allows even novice users to quickly learn how to save maps without any hassle.
- **Offline Functionality** — Google Map Saver can be used offline, providing users the convenience to save maps without an internet connection.
- **Batch Processing** — Users can save multiple maps in one go, greatly improving efficiency for those who require many maps at once.
- **Watermark Removal** — Options are available to remove watermarks by following simple instructions in the program's About section, enhancing the presentation of saved maps.

